finding('correct','12 rows do not prove 12 public attempts','The consolidated log has 12 public rows and one local reread, with nine distinct targets: eight HTTPS URLs and one search pseudo-URI. B003 folds a spinner failure and one retry into one public row, establishing at least 13 public attempts. The underlying browser list also separates navigate/download actions that cannot be mapped to exact additional HTTP requests from this package. The known lower bound is within 30 events/20 targets, but complete cap compliance and exact count cannot be certified.',A+'logs/attempted_urls.json',A+'logs/browser_attempts.json')
